      "writtenOn": "2018-02-01T19:45:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think where we\u0027re already raising 404s we can\u0027t trade it for a 401. But I think we could trade the 404 Project Not Found for a 404 Token Not Found.\n\nFor the case of deleting an IdP I\u0027m not sure what we should do. I think a 404 is not correct and also a bit too much information from a security point of view. But keeping things consistent is valuable too. ¯\\_(ツ)_/¯",
