      "writtenOn": "2018-02-01T21:14:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, I agree. I meant we should trade raising a 404 Project Not Found from the resource API to raising a 401 Unauthorized, which gets excepted later and traded for a 404 Token Not Found. We\u0027d be invoking a 404 by way of raising a 401, which does seem kind of funny but apparently that seems like the intended way to do things based on how the business logic of the token provider API is setup - shrug... idk, i just work here :) \n\nI can pull this down and work on another revision to see what that would look like if that helps.",
